WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.564
Caregivers for aging-in-place seniors provide the human care. Aurora adds the view between visits.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:11.691
Every client on one screen, so your team sees who needs attention first.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.520
Arrive knowing what matters: a missed dose, or a reading outside her range.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:23.281
An abnormal heart rate reaches the Angels she chose, with her usual range beside it.

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:30.215
Care that reaches past the visit: vitals, trends, medicines, appointments and labs.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:36.116
When she taps Aurora Help, her Angels get an emergency alert, even on silent.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.308
Aurora Care. Stay close to the people who matter most.
